WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:0
Five hidden ships (17 cells) on a 10×10 sea each.
Sink the whole enemy fleet first to win.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.500 line:0
Place ships: pick one, then tap its bow square;
rotate it, or place the fleet at random.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:20.000 line:0
Confirm once all five ships are legal;
the fleet cannot be changed afterwards.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000 line:0
Once both fleets are confirmed, players alternate:
tap a cell of the enemy sea to fire.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.999 line:0
Both first shots miss; North’s second shot hits.

00:00:33.999 --> 00:00:41.999 line:0
Fast-forward: after a hit, probe nearby cells;
a hit never says which ship it struck.

00:00:41.999 --> 00:00:50.999 line:0
One more hit fills the four-cell battleship:
a sinking reveals the ship’s name and cells.

00:00:50.999 --> 00:01:01.999 line:0
Fast-forward: both search using only misses, hits
and sinkings; ships still afloat stay hidden.

00:01:01.999 --> 00:01:10.999 line:0
North still has one unresolved hit;
firing at its neighbour sinks the last ship.

00:01:10.999 --> 00:01:20.000 line:0
North wins: 41 shots, 17 hits, all 5 ships sunk.
Both fleets are revealed only after the match.
